    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>{ v e l o c i t y }</i> is a momentum based puzzle-platformer game about saving and loading velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >imagine if ultrakill's movement and portal's atmosphere were taken and violently shaken until they became one small 12 oz serving of speed (not the drug, the concept of speed.), was thrown into dirt, and dropkicked onto a computer monitor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >that'd be { v e l o c i t y }. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the movement is composed of two main things. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. THE MOVEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fairly standard movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD movement, space to jump, shift to dash, and left control to crouch/slide. no speed limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. THE TOOLS (THE COOL STUFF)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Velocity Saver</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the velocity saver, as you can tell from the name, saves velocity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >right mouse button to save, left click to use saved velocity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portable Gravity Pulser</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0left mouse button to push object. right mouse to pull.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portable Speed Swapper</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 left mouse button to swap velocity with an object.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Portable Universal Spacial Fourth Dimensional Positional Swapper (patent pending.)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 most people we show that name to have a stroke.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 right mouse button to set position. left mouse button to go to set position.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret 5th thing</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >really powerful</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIND MORE FEATURES\u00a0<i>RIGHT NOW!!!! GIVE ME YOUR MONEY IN EXCHANGE FOR GOODS AND SERVICES!!!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >still not convinced? <strong>i know where you sleep at night.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(pretty sure valve would kill me if i didnt tell you that was a joke (pretty sure valve would kill me if i didnt tell you that valve killing me was a joke (valve will kill me regardless)))</i></p>",
